Subject: [PATCH 2/2] model: ownership decide_v2 closing tie and rank-one holes

- decide_v2 reproduces frozen decide() exactly when flags off (parity test)
- tie_break: exact-probability ties resolve to one deterministic owner
- cover_rank_one: rescued rank-one links (t_first..threshold) compete for
  ownership, closing the bypass that left multi-owner targets

